1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,600
 If you trade, you should screenshot this, or you might lose $10 million.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:07,840
 There's six steps in trading, but most people forget the fifth one.

3
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:12,440
 Every quant strategy goes through the same six steps before it touches real money.

4
00:00:12,840 --> 00:00:16,280
 And if you trade on your phone, you're probably skipping straight to the last one.

5
00:00:16,460 --> 00:00:17,920
 Think of it like opening a restaurant.

6
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:19,560
 Step one is data.

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,720
 That's your groceries.

8
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:24,440
 Prices, news, how much money each company makes.

9
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:26,720
 Bad groceries equals bad food.

10
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:27,980
 Step two is factors.

11
00:00:28,340 --> 00:00:29,280
 That's your recipe.

12
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:35,160
 A factor is just a clue that a stock might go up, like it's been going up for three months straight.

13
00:00:35,440 --> 00:00:36,800
 Step three is a back test.

14
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:38,180
 That's the taste test.

15
00:00:38,520 --> 00:00:42,360
 You try your recipe on past prices to see if it would have made money.

16
00:00:42,640 --> 00:00:44,240
 Step four is the portfolio.

17
00:00:44,740 --> 00:00:46,080
 That's your portion sizes.

18
00:00:46,460 --> 00:00:52,040
 In trading, that's how much money goes into each trade, so one bad trade can't sink the whole account.

19
00:00:52,320 --> 00:00:54,000
 Step five is paper trading.

20
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:55,520
 That's your soft opening.

21
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:59,400
 You trade the real market with fake money so nothing's on the line yet.

22
00:00:59,580 --> 00:01:01,460
 And step six, it's live trading.

23
00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:04,200
 That's the grand opening, real money.

24
00:01:04,380 --> 00:01:12,220
 Now, when you buy a stock because some guy on TikTok said so, you just open a restaurant with no groceries, no recipe, and no taste test.

25
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:16,740
 Quants do steps one through five before a single dollar goes in.

26
00:01:17,060 --> 00:01:20,020
 And now AI can help you with every one of those steps.

27
00:01:20,180 --> 00:01:22,960
 For the rest of the series, I'll walk you through each one.

28
00:01:23,140 --> 00:01:26,180
 Save this so you've got the map and follow for day three.

